const letter = `
Happy Birthday, meri jaan. 💗

Today is a special day, and I hope you know how much happiness, warmth and kindness you deserve. I wanted to make something a little different for your birthday, something that would feel like opening a tiny world full of surprises. This website is my collection of wishes, thoughts, smiles and little celebrations dedicated to you.

First of all, I hope your birthday begins with a beautiful smile. I hope you wake up feeling peaceful, appreciated and excited about everything waiting ahead. You deserve a day that makes you feel special, not because everything has to be perfect, but because you deserve to enjoy the little things that make life beautiful.

I hope this new chapter brings you countless opportunities to discover yourself. There are so many things waiting for you to explore. New places, new experiences, new friendships, new interests and new dreams. Never feel that you have to understand everything immediately. Life is a journey of learning, and every person moves at a different pace. Give yourself the freedom to grow naturally.

I wish you happiness that does not depend on expensive gifts or extraordinary occasions. I hope you find it in your favourite songs, your favourite food, a peaceful afternoon, a beautiful sunset, a funny conversation and those unexpected moments that make you smile without even realizing it.

I hope you always have people around you who genuinely care about you. People who listen to your thoughts, respect your opinions and encourage you to become the person you want to be. May you always experience friendships where kindness goes both ways and where you can be completely yourself without pretending.

I wish you courage. Courage to try something new, courage to speak about what matters to you, courage to follow your dreams and courage to start again when something does not go according to plan. You do not have to be perfect. You do not have to know every answer. Being willing to learn is already something wonderful.

I also wish you patience. Sometimes beautiful things take time. Some dreams need months or years of effort, and some plans change along the way. Do not compare your journey with somebody else's. Your life has its own timing, and your progress deserves to be appreciated even when it seems small.

Please remember to take care of yourself. Make time for rest, laughter, creativity and the activities you enjoy. You do not need to be productive every moment. You are allowed to pause, relax and enjoy a quiet day. Your wellbeing matters just as much as your goals.

May this year bring success in the things that are important to you. May you discover talents you did not know you had. May you find opportunities that help you learn and become more confident. When you achieve something, celebrate it. Even the smallest achievements deserve recognition.

I hope you laugh more this year. I hope there are silly jokes, funny pictures, spontaneous conversations and moments when you cannot stop smiling. I hope you make memories that become favourite stories later. Life is not only about reaching destinations. It is also about enjoying the journey.

Whenever life feels confusing, remember that you do not have to solve everything in one day. Take one step at a time. Ask for help when you need it. Give yourself the kindness you would give someone important to you. A difficult day is only one part of a much bigger story.

I hope you continue discovering the things that make you happy. Perhaps it is music, art, travelling, reading, learning something new or spending time with the people you love. Whatever those things are, I hope you never feel that you must give them up just because life becomes busy.

Thank you for being part of so many beautiful moments and memories. Every new day gives us another opportunity to learn, understand and appreciate the people around us. I hope the coming year gives you many moments worth remembering and many reasons to feel grateful.

May your birthday be filled with warmth. May your favourite people make you laugh. May your favourite food taste even better. May your favourite songs make the day brighter. May unexpected little surprises remind you that happiness can appear in simple ways.

I hope you always feel comfortable being yourself. You do not have to change your personality to make everyone happy. Your thoughts, interests, opinions and dreams are worth respecting. Keep learning, keep exploring and keep becoming the person you want to be.

May you find strength during challenges and peace during busy moments. May you have enough confidence to make your own decisions and enough wisdom to learn from experiences. Never underestimate how much you can accomplish through patience, kindness and consistent effort.

I wish you beautiful mornings, relaxing evenings, exciting adventures, meaningful friendships and unforgettable memories. I hope your future contains many opportunities that make you proud of yourself. I hope you look back at this birthday someday and remember it as the beginning of a wonderful chapter.

And finally, I want you to remember one simple thing: you deserve kindness, happiness, respect and genuine appreciation. Not just today, but throughout the year. Never forget to celebrate yourself, appreciate your progress and make space for the things that bring meaning to your life.

Happy Birthday once again, meri jaan. 🎂💗

May your new year be brighter, calmer, happier and more exciting than the last. May your dreams keep growing, may your smile keep returning, and may every chapter bring something beautiful to discover.

With lots of birthday wishes and endless good thoughts, this little website is dedicated to you. Enjoy every surprise, every game and every little page.

HAPPY BIRTHDAY! 💗✨
`;

const menu=document.getElementById("menu");
const content=document.getElementById("content");
let current=0;
let board=Array(9).fill("");
let turn="X",scores=[0,0];
let mem=[],selected=[],memPlayer=0,memScores=[0,0],memBusy=false;
let quizIndex=0,quizScores=[0,0],rpsScores=[0,0];
let musicContext=null,musicGain=null,musicOn=false;
let savedItems=[];

menu.innerHTML=names.map((n,i)=>
 `<button class="navbtn" data-id="${i}" onclick="go(${i})"><span class="navnum">${String(i+1).padStart(2,"0")}</span>${n}</button>`
).join("");

function go(i){
 current=i;
 document.getElementById("sectionTitle").textContent=names[i];
 document.getElementById("sectionNumber").textContent=`Section ${String(i+1).padStart(2,"0")} / 100`;
 document.getElementById("progress").style.width=((i+1))+"%";
 document.querySelectorAll(".navbtn").forEach((b,j)=>b.classList.toggle("active",i===j));
 document.getElementById("sidebar").classList.remove("open");
 render();
 window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:"smooth"});
}

function wishCards(){
 return `<div class="cards">${wishes.slice(0,6).map((w,i)=>
 `<div class="card"><strong>Wish ${i+1} ✨</strong><small>${w}</small></div>`
 ).join("")}</div>`;
}

function render(){
 let html=`<h2>${names[current]} 💗</h2>
 <p>${wishes[current%wishes.length]}</p>
 <p>${wishes[(current+3)%wishes.length]}</p>
